  _dialogue:
    _sentences:
    - 'Hey buddy, long sleep huh? '
    - 'You have such nice big windows in here.... What are you going to do when they''re
      gone? '
    - 'What will you do when this room is all corners? '
    - Can a corner even remember guys like us? The chances don't seem good, pal...
    - Well, I hate to say it, but you better get back in bed. Nothing good about
      a house in mourning.
